---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title={'Accessibility'} description={"Phoenix I/O's accessibility statement: WCAG 2.2 Level AA target, how we test, and how to report a problem."} page="accessibility">
<section class="page" id="p-accessibility" data-title="Accessibility">
  <div class="pagehead"><div class="wrap"><span class="label">Accessibility</span><h1>Accessible by standard.</h1><p class="lede">We build software for agencies bound by Section 508, and we hold our own site to the same standard.</p></div></div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
      <div class="stackL" style="gap:44px">
        <div class="block"><h2>Conformance target</h2><p>This site aims to conform to the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 Level AA, which exceeds the Section 508 baseline of WCAG 2.0 Level AA.</p></div>
        <div class="block"><h2>How we test</h2><p>Automated checks run on every change. Before each release we test with a keyboard only and with the NVDA and VoiceOver screen readers. Animation stops when your device asks for reduced motion. Last tested: October 2026.</p></div>
        <div class="block"><h2>Known exceptions</h2><p>None at this time.</p></div>
        <div class="quiet"><h3>Report a problem</h3><p>If anything on this site is hard to use, email <span class="mono" style="color:var(--text)">info@phoenixio.co</span> or call <span class="mono" style="color:var(--text)">+1 551-465-4595</span>. We respond within two business days.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>
</Base>
